__5__
 This C-UDA does not restrict your use, modification, or distribution of any portions of the Data that are in the public domain or that may be used, modified, or distributed under any other legal exception or limitation.
__5__
 Restrictions
__5__
 You agree that you will use the Data solely for Computational Use.
__5__
 The C-UDA does not impose any restriction with respect to the use, modification, or distribution of Results.
